    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Handle duplicated-email collisions in OAuth/headless as a terminal 409 conflict instead of surfacing as a retryable server error;\r\n- Clear pending OAuth verification state on duplicate-email conflict so the same verification token no longer gets stuck in a retry loop.\r\n- add integration coverage to assert first-attempt conflict, pending-state cleanup, and non-looping behavior on retry.\r\n\r\n> Avoid naming corporate partners, customers, or other sensitive external brands in this PR title or body. Use generic descriptors unless a maintainer explicitly approves the public reference.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\n- Aiming to improve the repo\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\n- Closes #198\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- [x] `cargo test --workspace --verbose`\r\n- [x] `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings -A deprecated`\r\n- [x] `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\r\n- [x] Manual verification completed\r\n\r\n## Visuals\r\n\r\n- [x] UI/web change with screenshots/video attached\r\n- [x] No visual change\r\n- [x] Visuals and text avoid sensitive external brand or partner names unless explicitly approved\r\n\r\n",
